2026-08-28T08:21:11Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T20:10:09Z","closed_at":"2026-08-31T19:55:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122916","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122916.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122916.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-31T19:55:07Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Should fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122891\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`GDType`'s owning thread check was always dodgy, but I had designed it this way to get quick notice of class registration outside the main thread.\r\nI've since established that \"main thread\" is more complicated on Android, and potentially in libgodot. Also, `GDType` will in the future likely be created on threads other than the main thread.\r\n\r\nThe surviving check is that `GDType` is created and finalized within the same thread (which I think is sensible to hold); https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117443 will establish that further by eagerly finalizing GDTypes.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repo